  "releaseNotes": "1.11.0: Harden shared memory bounds, launch guard fail-closed policy, incremental generator caching, IPC/Host/gRPC/MQTT/OPC UA lifecycles, WPF terminal reliability, and NuGet XML documentation and symbol packages. Includes documented Modbus/PLC enhancements, TLS, bounded MQTT/OPC UA subscriptions, secure OPC UA options and .NET 8 support for Modbus/MQTT/OPC UA.",
